      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CELINE has just dropped a new lineup of Triomphe Canvas bags, featuring fresh silhouettes like the Duffle shoulder bag, the Square Cabas tote, and a mini bucket bag. The iconic triumphal-arch monogram paired with practical shapes strikes the perfect balance between versatility and timeless appeal, all while exuding a nostalgic, scholarly charm.",
