      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Duffle Bag ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The standout of the new collection is this Duffle bag, which adopts a roomy bowling-bag silhouette with slender, elongated vegetable-tanned leather straps. The zipper extends naturally from both sides, adding a playful touch. Available in small and large sizes, the coated canvas is lightweight and scratch-resistant, blending style with practicality. The long strap lends an effortlessly chic Parisian vibe.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
