    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Trio Flap bag is crafted from the signature coated canvas and features a three-layer accordion structure. A top snap closure allows for quick access, while a slider strap offers multiple wearing options, from shoulder to crossbody. The Note Book shoulder bag takes inspiration from a notebook, with signature canvas and a natural calfskin lining. Inside, three card slots keep credit cards and small essentials organized, while the book-like shape radiates retro academic flair.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
